<title>USA: MBNA Sept 30 Q3 shr rises to $0.55.</title>
<headline>MBNA Sept 30 Q3 shr rises to $0.55.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.55		    $0.42</p>
<p> Net		 129,523		  97,327</p>
<p> Net interest inc160,905		  138,419</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  230,326		  229,155</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.38		    $1.07</p>
<p> Net		 325,065		  242,887</p>
<p> Net interest inc462,230		  395,965</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  230,088		  227,897</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is MBNA Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the nine months ended Sept 30 1996 included a $32.8 million tax benefit due to deductions for the amortization of customer based intangible assets, and a charge of $32.8 million net of tax related to the launch of MBNA's Platium Plus Visa and Mastercard program. Per common share data and weighted average share outstanding reflected the company's three-for-two stock split in February 1996.</p>
